#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example performs an open-loop steering test such as a constant amplitude and frequency sine sweep test.  It also demonstrates 4 wheel steering capabilities.
#
#The test is set up to have the vehicle accelerate from 0 - 120 km/h in 120 seconds and can be used for any vehicle in CarSim.
#
#Use the plots to analyze the steering wheel torque required to perform this steering input while the vehicle is accelerating.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

